  "_meta": {
    "subsystem": "thrusters_windlass",
    "source": "sheets 300,325,326,330,331,335,336,339,340,341 (+ feed sheet 400)",
    "voltage": 24,
    "note": "Electrical side of bow thruster (Sidepower SRV100/185TC opt 4090067 = sheet 325 / SRLP100/185TC-IP opt 4090070 = sheet 330; same physical install, alternative options), stern thruster (Sidepower SRLP100/185T-24V opt 4090070, sheets 335/336), anchor windlass (Maxwell RC10, sheets 340/341) and emergency-stop (sheet 300). Each thruster runs off its OWN dedicated 24V battery (2x12V 75Ah) via a 325A/ANL thruster fuse and 500A automatic main switch -S01; the service MSB only feeds a DC-DC charger to top up each thruster battery (bow -F26 25A, stern -F27 25A) and the windlass motor (via FA05 40A / F90). Bow thruster DOWN sensor on sheet 339. Remote RC-23E on sheet 326 drives windlass NO1/NO2. E-STOP relay -K01 (sheet 300) provides hydraulic-stop interlock contacts cross-referenced into windlass sheet 340.7D."
  },
